WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.292 --> 00:00:02.503
I haven’t heard from Owen in 24 hours.

00:00:02.586 --> 00:00:04.338
Your husband is not who you think he is.

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:10.219
What defines you?

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:11.970
Well, what defines you?

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:15.265
I asked first.

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:18.435
There’s nothing I wouldn’t do
for my daughter.

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:22.356
Mrs. Michaels?

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:24.066
Mr. Michaels asked me to give this to you.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.075
Sorry, ma’am.
The building’s closed.

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:35.410
My husband works inside.
I’m trying to reach him

00:00:35.661 --> 00:00:38.080
I haven’t heard from Owen in 24 hours.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:40.582
Where’s my dad?

00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:42.292
I don’t know.
What is that?

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:53.554
Are you okay?

00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:55.305
I can’t believe this is happening.

00:00:56.014 --> 00:00:57.975
Your husband is not who you think he is.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:01.395
Why are you making him sound like
some criminal mastermind.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:05.607
I may not know why your father did
what he did, but I know who he is.

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:09.611
He lied to me and then he disappeared,
and I want to know the truth!

00:01:10.654 --> 00:01:11.697
I’m telling you we’ll find him.

00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:16.660
Hannah, you need to get out of there now.

00:01:17.286 --> 00:01:19.496
-Where did you get this?
-Tell me who sent you!

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:21.248
Go. Now!

00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:25.210
Hannah and her step-daughter
are in imminent danger.

00:01:26.128 --> 00:01:27.713
Is there something you’re not telling me?

00:01:28.255 --> 00:01:29.882
We need to stay together.

